From 6660d53f086278c8ee4397ceb17c6141094e0fef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daryl Denson <9751141+denson9874@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:25:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] recovery: show ExpressiveOS's mark instead of Evolution X's

ExpressiveOS is its own ROM: recovery and fastbootd showed Evolution X's
E in the logo pill and traced it in the install animation. Draw
ExpressiveOS's four petals there instead, in the same blue outline, and
let a light run around them while an update installs. The text, the
R/F switch icons and the colours stay as they were.

Made with expressiveos-cheetah/branding/tools/make-brand.py from the
ExpressiveOS logo.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
